hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"171","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas witr ka zikr kiya. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Raha main, to main raat ke pehle hisse mein witr padhta hun; aur Umar ne kaha: Raha main, to main raat ke aakhri hisse mein witr padhta hun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh muhtat hai aur yeh qawi hai.'"
"172","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne raat ke har hisse mein witr padha hai, aur Aap ka witr sahar tak pahunchta raha."
"173","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr se farmaya: 'Tum kab witr padhte ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Sone se pehle, ya kaha: Raat ke pehle hisse mein. Aur farmaya: 'Ai Umar, tum kab witr padhte ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Raat ke aakhri hisse mein. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya main tum dono ke liye ek misal bayan na karun? Raha tu ai Abu Bakr, to us ki tarah hai jis ne kaha: Main ne apna hissa [nahbi, yani sahmi] mehfooz kar liya, aur woh nawafil talab karta hai; aur raha tu ai Umar, to tu taqatwaron ke amal par amal karta hai.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: [Nahbi] yani mera hissa [sahmi]."
"174","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Abi Hathmah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi sutre ki taraf [munh karke] namaz padhe to us ke qareeb ho jae, taake shaitan us ki namaz na kate.'"
